    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ship Is Malfunctioning! Find A Cactus, Quick! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Need It to Re-start the Quantum Widgets!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Go!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.poster.avif?t=1752222117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.webm?t=1752222117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.mp4?t=1752222117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic quest through a sprawling spaceship in search of vital parts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a meticulously designed spaceship with its 128 unique rooms, each filled with surprises, challenges, and mind-bending puzzles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a multitude of whacky enemies that will test your wit and reflexes along the way.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly piranhas! Teddy bears with propeller blades! Crazed medi-bots! Giant robot-eating plants! Gnomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/081d4fb8e45b3921a2997852ee290f77.poster.avif?t=1752222117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/081d4fb8e45b3921a2997852ee290f77.webm?t=1752222117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/081d4fb8e45b3921a2997852ee290f77.mp4?t=1752222117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Mainframe Knows All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should listen to that thing, it's really smart. Just get the stuff it's asking for, right?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ship Is Malfunctioning! Find A Cactus, Quick! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Need It to Re-start the Quantum Widgets!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Go!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.poster.avif?t=1752222117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.webm?t=1752222117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.mp4?t=1752222117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic quest through a sprawling spaceship in search of vital parts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a meticulously designed spaceship with its 128 unique rooms, each filled with surprises, challenges, and mind-bending puzzles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a multitude of whacky enemies that will test your wit and reflexes along the way.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly piranhas! Teddy bears with propeller blades! Crazed medi-bots! Giant robot-eating plants! Gnomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/081d4fb8e45b3921a2997852ee290f77.poster.avif?t=1752222117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/081d4fb8e45b3921a2997852ee290f77.webm?t=1752222117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras